<title>THAILAND: TelecomAsia's raise capital of unit.</title>
<headline>TelecomAsia's raise capital of unit.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TelecomAsia Corp Plc said on Wednesday that it had given approval to its subsidiary Asia Multimedia Co Ltd to increase registered capital to 6.5 billion baht ($250 million) from 50 million baht.</p>
<p>TelecomAsia said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand that the approval was given by the company's board last Friday.</p>
